[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4920.31, "timestamp": "01:22:00", "text": "嗯，然后呢？是啊，我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4925.669, "timestamp": "01:22:05", "text": "想 呃，我，该怎么说呢？我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4928.629, "timestamp": "01:22:08", "text": "今天提交了一些支持工单，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4931.83, "timestamp": "01:22:11", "text": "想问一些疑问之类的，因为我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4934.229, "timestamp": "01:22:14", "text": "一直想问。你知道，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4937.11, "timestamp": "01:22:17", "text": "关于"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4941.43, "timestamp": "01:22:21", "text": "Sammy的这些操作，有件挺搞笑的事儿，就是我现在每次打开"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4948.149, "timestamp": "01:22:28", "text": "Discord服务器或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4950.07, "timestamp": "01:22:30", "text": "他们的支持服务器，都会发个帖子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4952.39, "timestamp": "01:22:32", "text": "说我需要帮助，比如这个功能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4955.51, "timestamp": "01:22:35", "text": "用不了之类的。发完帖子之后，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4958.47, "timestamp": "01:22:38", "text": "就像我写完关于帖子内容的描述，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4962.55, "timestamp": "01:22:42", "text": "按下回车键之后，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4965.91, "timestamp": "01:22:45", "text": "脑子里突然冒出一个念头：其实"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4968.87, "timestamp": "01:22:48", "text": "你可以用另一种方式，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4971.59, "timestamp": "01:22:51", "text": "不用搞得这么复杂。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4975.35, "timestamp": "01:22:55", "text": "然后我就想：哦，原来如此。那"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4979.27, "timestamp": "01:22:59", "text": "我为什么还要发这个帖子呢？"}]